emailTemplates.body:
Hello {{payerName}} Provider Network Team,

We would like to add the provider below to our group's participation with {{payerName}}. Please confirm the network is open and send the next steps or application.

Provider: {{providerName}}, {{credentials}}
Specialty: {{specialty}}
Individual NPI: {{npi}}
Group NPI: {{groupNpi}}
TIN: {{tin}}
CAQH ID: {{caqhId}} (current and attested)
Practice: {{practice}}
Location: {{address}}

Thank you,
{{senderName}}

Hello,

{{providerName}}'s CAQH ProView profile (CAQH ID {{caqhId}}) has been updated, re-attested, and {{payerName}} is authorized to view it.

Case #: {{caseNo}}

Please proceed with credentialing and let us know if anything else is needed.

Thank you,
{{senderName}}

Hello,

I'm following up on the application for {{providerName}} (NPI {{npi}}).

Reference #: {{referenceNo}}
Submitted: {{submittedDate}}
Days since submission: {{daysSinceSubmit}}

Could you share the current status, the committee date if scheduled, and an estimated completion date?

Thank you,
{{senderName}}
